#: scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67b630d36d2d8ce5ea79ac648955d8c3102b290278fc940198991bc1f500ab7
#. default-sha256: 89d9d344c3c5d282aa2ad1ba3d2e03dfd35a2b16dedea2e9fe7ade22a2d8a0c9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"The next thing I know, I’m sinking into a vast void."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫気付け"
"ば、⟪k:17⟫私は――一筋の光も差さない暗闇の底に、⟪k:18⟫沈んでいた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24b2641edfcd2b8fb122477db96220cf6a100d142ebbeb5edd6182c59f0c095a
#. default-sha256: 2e8709b26a99cd723437521516915da17d88efe1cac8ab93da78373be9a0b972
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darkness cuffs my hands and legs, restricting my movement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私の手足を闇の手が絡み取り、⟪k:1⟫身動きも碌に出来ない。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30b0f6778fdc15679cacca8269d4089abe7f3e877acaa4dcc26b24426794fd28
#. default-sha256: 41e5c3ad18ea5beae9609f6ecbcc42d543744596711b2243aa2e8562948e93b5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Images of the past I had kept buried away for so long stream past me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫目を逸らし続けてきた過去の光景が、⟪k:1⟫私の面前を過ぎ去っていく……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5f712db890c040e6b0e2d07524a848910d996020064058760d92c62eee0aa4e
#. default-sha256: 3f7af8b7b16b3c926e09fddb8d7af903ef7ad23c11383564ce09920eaa9e5f2d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This isn’t how I wanted it to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫こんな形で知られたくなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d9ee6b77834a98bad32c1ee5fe3d6997b4bfa96e463568a5f4bfefac53ea6aa
#. default-sha256: 5d7a9782be65a005d4f6b0a010009204858e9e69106e26198ba754ecc1f88788
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not coming from my own mouth, but being laid bare for all to see without my consent."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私の出生の秘密を……、⟪k:1⟫私の情けない過去を……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38b94281dd2f5bc9646e87712ef73c7ec3205e1ad77a3d01677b6206b822c52b
#. default-sha256: d044f35b71eeefe1462ce817ce2dd77f4d782223b55dd2d0d8477c97df015596
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t how I wanted her to find out about my secret.⟪k:1⟫About my shameful history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自らの口で告げるのではなく……暴かれる形で……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼女にだけは……知られたくなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3a8100a0a0dfda80f8bc902977d2ff4fa0b9efe1804f1e447a6e1f62ba55564
#. default-sha256: c1556ce38e95ae6a80fdac791399f285836e4ab316c367f65562fafb85e97e4e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I warned you, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I told you you didn’t want to reclaim your old self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから言ったんですよ。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あなたは自分を取り戻してはいけないって。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02cbb8ab87038a7fe6ffe634529573fec5a51d5b29c7e7d1eedd7fa8073c2036
#. default-sha256: 722241be91f0fb4dfedad00d16eaf1aaeb28c7fc002f8a8901b3d1193cd30d92
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you had simply let it be, you wouldn’t be here now, forced to relive it all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫失ったままでいたら、⟪k:1⟫こんなにも辛い過去を……見つめ直さなくても良かったのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bca2377dd5bc9755c382349c5346ffee552b2b3c1e44f1db01b23438c443fc3a
#. default-sha256: 03e0a8cdc9471617c96190ab11b254aa80c5dc2fe1b45fd9baa4d7c04862b181
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now do you understand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale I spun behind the fourth door...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was as "
"much for you as it was for her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫分かったでしょう？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私が作った四番目のお話は……、⟪k:3⟫あなたのためでもあったのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f286aa16cc0b68f54da06994c4769027fb4716756cd3be2f76986c47334da735
#. default-sha256: 4611ac5d54b6cecb81d573a2561ad22fdc026dbc4cc75344fc7221e393f94cee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There, you were a young man with a sad fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あの世界の中で、⟪k:1⟫あなたは悲しい運命を背負った男性で――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acd1d70b32fb0ef36fb37d45a0eda4dafeed9d19cc8347802a884c8838bfd364
#. default-sha256: 771147c5a533b96242511d6c9cd45aeb5be19dc1afbc403dd176ab2e0f50770e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but you met a wonderful woman, fell in love with her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれども優しい女性と心が繋がって――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 001a8d097ce16aa2923d4dc4d1e28a6890501973758fc2e71128157e70944157
#. default-sha256: b70719e3e0d6c7bb5e2debff17b7c166a4e4849aa47319c7cc764bfc8a8211c5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then died in the arms of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫悲劇の渦中で命を落とす……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb374deb9c6a04ec7fe1c18442275c3b16e23431f2ad84065738d18ce15d1346
#. default-sha256: 47bfa10be04c2f3f847872f92f820594993cdb204c24dd992641dd34d9921227
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sequence of events is not far from the truth, but I was able to turn it into something "
"enchanting and beautiful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたの真実と流れは変わっていないのに、⟪k:1⟫ずいぶんと神秘的で美しい話になったじゃないです"
"か。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3de5953379febcf3f1754478be48764fdb362372fd818437de0908aa0c6c16d7
#. default-sha256: a380adc6fe105cb90d9a36ab7a14a6e5de9b46c2ca27a2ea096943148667181e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I got rid of all the nasty little details—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その肉体の秘密も、⟪k:1⟫あなた自身の醜さも、⟪k:2⟫生々しいものは何も――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7AFC74F4_8115_4B73_ACB9_19516C6C1639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ec56191e373b8d05939ed1eb5b9d7e11a69c6f847cf75dab3e7ea57a70f95db
