#: scenario7:scenario7_A61B843E_6FBB_4813_AB1A_9706B0A29741
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c5b0bcd1f5dc4d3af01fb5a7a7d561bed98e40ba0d25e0ddf2bd29f5233aa6e
#. default-sha256: ff5710d7b5c9a3a89b157b535337b7fb14a3c139d9481feb9301d02295533c3f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A61B843E_6FBB_4813_AB1A_9706B0A29741"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t it seem a bit unfair, Michel?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You tore down the walls around Giselle’s "
"heart, around her past,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ねえミシェル……、⟪k:1⟫ずるいじゃないですか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ジゼルの過去は――彼女の心の傷は、⟪k:4⟫暴"
"いておいて。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_66CA2B35_CBEA_453C_B4CA_045F2AA56432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 368d3164489d000d4c04473d20926c5b7c11b63c9c9d454eba5e757d61e155c4
#. default-sha256: 296cf4b28ed0651ac23618f1d9b561538746302e8a5186163759021e21b290f7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_66CA2B35_CBEA_453C_B4CA_045F2AA56432"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but you wanted to keep your own nice and safe and hidden away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それなのに自分の傷はひた隠しにするなんて。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_487160CF_D97E_429C_8936_DFF965E16044
