msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were afraid she wouldn’t accept you, were you not?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――彼女の拒絶が恐ろしかったんですよね？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1078AA23_182D_43D3_9C56_21BE25236266
