msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3CB6D232_B56D_4D48_9A1A_793C42F14A17"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The prince who came riding in to save her—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だって――、⟪k:1⟫自分を救いに来てくれた王子様が、⟪k:2⟫まさか――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCECC895_16DD_4B6C_8432_FB9AEAA2FCB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b62df9eecac4c2d65ffaf708b025dc219eb867881983ca5784c9226605b2045b
