"⟪k:18⟫首都の城壁が遠ざかっていったのも、⟪k:19⟫ずいぶん前のことで――⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫あれから馬車は、"
"⟪k:22⟫ひたすら走り続けた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABDA3FD6_2F53_4B77_8D55_365B3A717DC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05d22c3a0c5862ab9a2f39344eaff493ce4d418d3c445941c1e9474560a0bdf7
#. default-sha256: 3267caf495b57880956f1b8d9f066171a9a7c4856328f4359b48169f61ad5a74
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABDA3FD6_2F53_4B77_8D55_365B3A717DC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’d long since left paved roads behind. The carriage rocked back and forth as it proceeded "
"down the rough dirt path."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫舗装もままなっていないむき出しの土道は、⟪k:1⟫馬車を左へ右へと大きく揺らす。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4506c26d16a8c486eb3e6073a450992fd88ed5e8b17a90a36c5a77cd4a976d2f
#. default-sha256: 7b89a27ad246e261041c53884cbe7692b86b016934f4430861ec91ac7c8681b0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For hours, I stared through the window as unfamiliar scenery flowed past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私はずっと、⟪k:1⟫見知らぬ景色を眺めつづけていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea244c201f14f5ffeba2e32e34f30e1c03e5b8e194fdd9f2d3e51af28866a45e
#. default-sha256: e3dc26e933ecc43affdce34bc0f89e5fc385d70d727337afa32bd7bc3eb37191
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually, a fog settled over the area, making it difficult to discern night from day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫やがて霧がけむり――、⟪k:1⟫世界の明暗を曖昧にさせていく。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1e019b862efdf2ddefca5ce02dfc48a0dc007bb93c85eedba9af1ef9481b6ad
#. default-sha256: 8141a1d533cb0c34a25b3383540e06e4ac19f2325f8348ac3d8a9bdad041064d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We made our way through dark, dense woods,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫鬱蒼と茂る闇の森を抜けると――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bae6861f23374ea539c1d6dbec0d4a80ca03d314b0dc2ab4cb47c204ad574ff
#. default-sha256: b5f60ac9fd477698c86fba1ffe0f78667a1e55ef0a00f84b7554a133b835bd4b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and beyond them, like the world fading into view after a dream,⟪k:1⟫a mansion appeared "
"before us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その屋敷は、⟪k:1⟫寝起きざまのように忽然と現れた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5cb9721a3122c12ddc7c42ad47fb5b803b0c59e3156794267c3d066a685c889
#. default-sha256: a763c351219140bf3f2ebf26b759d4ae0a418a1535e9e29f7958641cedfb1a5e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫すべての窓が鎧戸や木板で閉ざされた、⟪k:3⟫暗闇の館……。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫それは実家の幽閉生活"
"を彷彿とさせるものだった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf3abe5b71d7cbcf181f771f371d75c22a35002b10495b235a9caf18644cfedc
#. default-sha256: 46092812c652db3bfa3d311a5ee2f8726c41704a0f898f736ec9e5cb26a5b8f7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私の姿を見せないために、⟪k:1⟫このように窓を閉ざしたのかと思ったが――、私が来るのはつい最近決"
"まったことだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71db1d188e5e8bb6a3c5c3feb392534df583d01c64aef151ceea3058eeb34f74
#. default-sha256: 3b85e35d60041c5db498f157ab5df0281a77afad6f8cec452c3043185974d197
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More likely, then, the house had been in this condition when it was initially purchased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ならば、⟪k:1⟫最初からこの屋敷はこうだったのだろう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫恐らくは買い取った時から……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb897e8ec70bbb08664387c8e07b52e02659cd4994bd5bdb9f963cc9ce714bbe
#. default-sha256: 8499527f04e8574dc114f0461962f3f22e8990e572feb3d8fc9feaea3db1a734
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quite the piece of property my father had found himself with.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wondered if he had "
"been swindled by its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ずいぶんな屋敷を手に入れたものだ、⟪k:1⟫と思った。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫父は仲介人に騙されてしまったのかも"
"しれない。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8221c05d42ae2c6e8debb93e0af8df6dab90ac9167458944c51d0c77fcc9eede
#. default-sha256: 284da03501ca81e4e2d38565a734ed9b658a21b4c1f2e6f3407a0c3cb3134936
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a gloomy, uninviting place, but it didn’t appear to be in disrepair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫近づくのも憚れるような陰鬱な気配をまとう屋敷ではあったが、⟪k:1⟫それでも外壁は補修されており、"
"⟪k:2⟫廃墟とまではいかなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f082c540b45f52be72290dcf70da65fe5ff9b09af77d38b2ed92d4d3be30a6cc
#. default-sha256: 639f6b299e1d2e14a32c5430505adb685bccfda221f1395cec1f6bc16a9b7152
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The coachman left my luggage outside the door, gave me an empty farewell, and then went "
"on his way."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫御者は私と荷物を屋敷の入り口に残し、⟪k:2⟫形式だけの一礼を済ませて去っていった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b2f6b6f2e6edeba69a27dc86aaae8fee610a59ad1a1dcb08fe608846a432f62
#. default-sha256: 25ece649685ab5784455816777983d8e7b87ae7274f99b7cb0abb26b746904d1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫entirely alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は完全に……ひとりになった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_482E3049_2539_49D9_B7CA_842612330E9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7453ee58c6bfd4ee69c6d69d1ec19520f36648100ad94f4b5721adab2f4f0941
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_482E3049_2539_49D9_B7CA_842612330E9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1d326abb4a3b6b457ef4c6cac5faa3ab75be080acbade26ba416d23c1b895cf
#. default-sha256: 589a7ba3492ab42e386ba9088a3431e8fa647f882b47eadcca833a84733df219
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spent some time just staring out at the forest, but naturally, there was nothing of "
"interest to be found there. ⟪k:1⟫So I quietly turned around and opened the door to the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しばらく森の景色を眺めていたが――、⟪k:1⟫それで何が変わるという話でもない。⟪k:2⟫私は何も言わ"
"ず……屋敷の扉を開いた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab2d284c88650945706e78eb754c1490a409e57c12804ca42c8b9ab88953364f
#. default-sha256: 0c6d2bfc784a88ede83ea29f395c057e583698b4010afb557dcc07cd791d4f18
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s certainly dark..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫暗いな………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2da789e45aac7f45e1a1591fb7dd8f9154fbcdd988b80ec7e14e187645e32122
#. default-sha256: 50164224081357c6df6737f0bc9aca4dbf713ef848588f9b088990762a8868da
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could barely even see my own feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫足元すらおぼつかない暗闇が、⟪k:1⟫屋敷を支配している。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e092757045022332ffb11b1628f4063dc67ad043581527acb3bb257fa05033c1
#. default-sha256: 187565fa48047bee9bfc674070e0f600a1799fde9a53e7915ec3528fb18e7216
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I considered trying to unshutter a window or two, but ended up deciding against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どこかの鎧戸を外すべきか悩んだが、⟪k:1⟫そのままにしておくことにした。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccfcd2034fecf3abad8659a835791958034e04da6cc489cdd51a0d780ff4c423
#. default-sha256: 77ff87adaeb85a927db6467a99faa8c0d70801761a606efebf534606fdc6ea90
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The less inviting the place looked, the easier it would be for me to avoid contact with the "
"outside world, as Didier had recommended."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫屋敷が不気味であればある程、⟪k:1⟫私自身も外界から遮断される。⟪k:2⟫ディディエの言った、⟪k:3⟫他"
"人と関わるなという忠告も容易く守れるというものだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76161ed2f328a84b56c8b145387af21d3fbeeb7eb88583b9c747a12f5354f6a6
#. default-sha256: 92ef2b5568693ec13168df60c91a4f293b59a5adedc80476577c6728dcd7d4d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Standing there in the darkness for several minutes, my eyes gradually grew accustomed to the "
"lack of light. ⟪k:1⟫While it was hardly ideal, it was sufficient to take a look around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫闇の中でじっとしていると、⟪k:1⟫やがて目が慣れる。⟪k:2⟫普段通りとはいかないが、⟪k:3⟫屋敷を見て"
"回るくらいは出来るようになった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1477d74ed1311360566960d6766c4a876cc18332a7ce313b0da08ce8a169b06
#. default-sha256: 660851656e7127bf667e1fbe15f667bd5b18060e9a3cacec72546902078417c7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The inside didn’t seem to have received the same level of care as the outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"everything was dusty and the air was many years stale. ⟪k:3⟫But I wasn’t in a cleaning mood,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫室内までは清掃が行き渡っておらず、⟪k:1⟫埃や黴臭さが鼻をついたが、⟪k:2⟫掃除は後回しにし――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c569cc4281622590084ca70cce312f9aa286a5789ecb7b0b85e11cfbe54af28
#. default-sha256: d331b6b2b9050b19bd2edc5af2ecc43793cbb15e648a78491ec64a6bc4238028
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so I dug through my luggage for a bundle of candles, lighting one with a flint."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫荷物から蝋燭の束を見つけると、⟪k:1⟫火打石で炎を作り上げた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9C16AE7A_4C5F_453F_B2FF_F8ED60FD6DD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b68fa76f57822aeaa00b32beb82a560a214adacbe1845c2c8151877f6548a957
#. default-sha256: 3c49f4f33d10ad395c226f5fc9eebf31c0c05bb5eea6c16121bdfc8e5ad87df2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9C16AE7A_4C5F_453F_B2FF_F8ED60FD6DD4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………これは………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9C229545_33D1_471B_BC3C_74EEADDDC7E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f53428e96126543dc9e8d2ebc23ccaac202ab68238f71dda5a62f9eaa00db4ef
#. default-sha256: d812d311c1eb27287e5cfca1dca117c6dd357655c7520742ce058aea89d9fc84
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9C229545_33D1_471B_BC3C_74EEADDDC7E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stained-glass window...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ステンドグラス……？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B12DF282_261A_452D_8216_44715016049B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d1c19cf230ec3cb8c8b2cc7a463024ef807a972b95649b02feae822a3ccabe0
#. default-sha256: 83bab6246958473449844241f1493fc86ff66736482fb3a6e632b57c86f6f7ea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B12DF282_261A_452D_8216_44715016049B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Examining the large room I found myself in,⟪k:9⟫I "
"came across a stained-glass window depicting an angel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫辿り付いた広い部屋を見渡すと、⟪k:9⟫天使のステンドグラ"
"スがあった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BABA6C9B_0ECB_4777_BA6C_CD417E6912E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 424901c06832d93a8f7c3ba52cda6e5e40d806c1ba7fc524229e7b0421f28146
#. default-sha256: 51918d454366b4416399631cc411dab024de1eea12f007a366665df76fe25c1b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BABA6C9B_0ECB_4777_BA6C_CD417E6912E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The archangel—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after whom I had been named—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫looked solemnly down upon me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――私の名前の由来になった存在が、⟪k:1⟫おごそかに見下ろしている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BD94362B_1353_4109_AA78_C4B97929DB77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc88d00d3a2d8a7cb790f39f00f09c41d62d158e18c8060107a9f5c0bd86fbed
#. default-sha256: 2a0f639e1d6d91df6732166f1eba60fbc1d8b6bff533873bd0604b13efca06f5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BD94362B_1353_4109_AA78_C4B97929DB77"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Quite the joke..."
